# The backup sidecar image (Dockerfile here) COPYs nothing from its build context: it installs
# from Alpine and GitHub, and every backup script is bind-mounted at run time. On a live host
# this directory also holds old exports and archives (gitignored, many GB). BuildKit sends only
# what a COPY names, but the legacy builder (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0) and any future `COPY .` would
# send all of it to the daemon. Send nothing: Docker always sends the Dockerfile and this file.
# A future COPY names its file here as `!<name>`.
*
